  "question": {
    "text": "If the circle <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></math> intersects the line <math><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi></math> at two distinct points, then the number of possible integral values of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi></math> is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
