  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The equation of the circle is <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />Its centre is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and radius is <math><msqrt><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math>&nbsp;units<br />It the circle intersects the line <math><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi></math> at two distinct points, then the length of the perpendicular from the centre is less than the radius<br />i.e., <math><mfrac><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>5</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>25</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>35</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>15</mn></math></p><p>Hence, the total number of integral values of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>49</mn></math>&nbsp;</p>",
    "image": null
  },
